# Gitignored files Claude Code copies into every worktree it creates (`--worktree`, subagent
# worktrees, desktop parallel sessions — https://code.claude.com/docs/en/worktrees.md).
# Only files that match here AND are gitignored are copied. A configured WorktreeCreate hook
# replaces this mechanism.
#
# CLAUDE.local.md carries the operator's local pins (reply register, standing requests). Without
# it a worktree session starts with no register pin and drifts — measured 2026-11-02: a desktop
# side session answered in 해라체 (10 of 14 Korean sentences) while the main session held 반말.
CLAUDE.local.md
